# Tangled Colony (3/2): "This creature can't block." On turn 4 Bot2's Grizzly Bears attacks Bot1, who controls the Colony and an
# Ornithopter: blocking with the Colony is refused, and the Ornithopter may block (the positive control).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Tangled Colony
Ornithopter
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Grizzly Bears
Forest x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tangled Colony.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Tangled Colony.Keywords = CantBlock
[T4 Bot2.Attackers]
Bot2.Attack(Grizzly Bears > Bot1)
[T4 Bot2.Blockers]
! Bot1.Block(Tangled Colony > Grizzly Bears)
Bot1.Block(Ornithopter > Grizzly Bears)

[Expect]
Combat.Blocks = Ornithopter > Grizzly Bears
